# \# HEOS UI

# 

# Modern Python UI component library for Home Energy OS.

# 

# \## Features

# 

# \- Design Tokens

# \- Button

# \- Badge

# \- Card

# \- Status Chip

# \- Battery Indicator

# \- Energy Value

# \- Power Flow Indicator

# \- Dashboard Layout

# 

# \## Installation

# 

# ```bash

# pip install heos-ui

# ```

# 

